  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Cloud bamboo mountain range is a large resource point dense with dao marks, where desolate beasts and plants grow as a matter of course. After exploring it, Fang Yuan obtains eleven desolate plants of three species: cloud qi root, white hair root, and spear tip bamboo.",
      "chapters": [
        1591
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "desolate-plant-haul",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Myriad Destruction Lightning Forest breaks Cloud Bamboo Mountain apart, white hair ginseng is destroyed with cloud qi roots and the mountain’s spear tip bamboo stock.",
      "chapters": [
        2038
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "destroyed-with-the-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_myriad_destruction_lightning_forest",
        "loc_cloud_bamboo_mountain_range"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the same mountain, Fang Yuan’s earlier haul of eleven desolate plants had named the third species white hair root beside cloud qi root and spear tip bamboo.",
